Fix architectural Prefer host-steal (Project→sale.order on linked SO asides)
and residual full_app noun collapse (Studio grain Full→x_full). Prefer-lock
project.project for Project form Extends; Name/model from brief business noun;
checklist/parts as honest O2M satellites. Prefer sale.order packs + Vehicle
Request + invent families stay green.
